<title>UK: SOCCER-GLASGOW RANGERS V AUXERRE LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GLASGOW RANGERS V AUXERRE LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas Deniaud scored in the 54th minute to give Auxerre of France a 1-0 lead over Glasgow Rangers of Scotland in their group A match in the European Cup Champions' League on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>Deniaud scored his second goal in the 68th minute to give Auxerre a 2-0 lead over Glasgow Rangers.  </p>
<p>Paul Gascoigne scored for Glasgow Rangers in the 71st minute to make the score 2-1 to Auxerre.</p>
